Changes made since V1 include:
- Fixed all the materials by going back into blender fixing the UVs and then baking all of the textures, allowing for minimal changes needed in Unreal Engine
- Imported the armature rig from my blender model for posing the robot
- Fixed a few of the models & materials such as the grass. I removed the ground from the blender mesh and added terrain via UE's landscape modeller
- Added lighting, some atmospherics, and a skybox
